# Public keys trusted to sign a skills release (docs/design/sdlc-skills-option-b.md).
#
# One PEM "PUBLIC KEY" block per key: ECDSA P-256, as `cosign public-key`
# prints it. A manifest signature that any key here verifies is accepted, so
# during a rotation the old and the new key are both listed.
#
# scripts/install-sdlc-skills.sh carries the same blocks inline; a test fails
# if the two differ.
#
# No key is listed yet: nothing is trusted, and the signed source is off
# unless an operator supplies their own key file.
